# BUG FIX 1 — train.py: GAE done-mask off-by-one (A001-fix)
#   RolloutBuffer.compute_returns_and_advantages: changed
#     next_non_terminal = 1.0 - self.dones[t + 1].item()   (WRONG)
#   to
#     next_non_terminal = 1.0 - self.dones[t].item()        (CORRECT)
#   Convention: dones[t] = terminated|truncated from env.step at step t,
#   meaning obs[t+1] is from a new episode when dones[t]=True.
#   Using dones[t+1] inverted the mask at every episode boundary.
#
# BUG FIX 2 — requirements.txt: removed torch pin (A002-fix)
#   torch==2.2.0 without --index-url installs a CPU-only wheel on RunPod,
#   overriding the pre-installed CUDA torch. Torch is now handled by the
#   Dockerfile (Docker) and the pre-installed image (RunPod).
#
# BUG FIX 3 — commands.json: explicit --output-dir $OUTPUT_DIR
#   ["python train.py"]  →  ["python train.py --output-dir \"$OUTPUT_DIR\""]
#   Ensures all artifacts (metrics.json, checkpoints) go to the writable
#   sandbox volume even if the env var is not inherited by the subprocess.

